ion, but also has excellent attention skills, puts concern for others above everything. We could argue that his concern for others and attention skills offset communication difficulty. Also note that his egocentric attitude may be mitigated by his crew atmosphere positivity. So we can reaffirm.\n\nThus produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE: \"I agree with Agent 2, still recommend Candidate C because ...\". Provide evidence: 100% reliability, positive crew atmosphere, quick correct decisions, calm in crisis, excellent attention, puts concern for others above everything. Acknowledge concerns: communication difficulty, egocentric, not willing to further education, but argue that his crew atmosphere and concern for others mitigate. Also note that other candidates have more serious crew cooperation issues (B's nasty remarks, D's moody/loner, A's criticism issues). So keep vote Candidate C.\n\nMETADATA_JSON: vote Candidate C.\n\nProceed."}
